{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1105619,\"title\":\"Ultra Galaxy Fight: New Generation Heroes\",\"tagline\":\"The Battle Against the \\\"League of Darkness\\\" Begins!\",\"overview\":\"Somewhere on a distant planet, X and Geed were defeated by a pair of black Ultramen who bore their likenesses in appearance. At the same time, an old enemy of Taro named Ultra Dark-Killer targeted both Zero and Grigio, forcing Taro to recruit the New Generation Heroes to stop the League of Darkness. This is the complete, director's cut version of the original web series with no breaks!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jZ7JUhCQ7c9EetbePDhTfKundkJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4aLtxZLbH5kt0Xc9fzQG0tA46UJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":5,\"year\":2020,\"runtime\":58,\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Koichi Sakamoto\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":145066,\"name\":\"Koichi Sakamoto\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wwKnhksYBo4e7mbHozsjv6hpVYH.jpg\"},{\"id\":1497414,\"name\":\"Takuya Negishi\",\"character\":\"Ultraman Ginga\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c3qJQNPFLu4Ha6NdGhkbQoSM0X3.jpg\"},{\"id\":1178883,\"name\":\"Kiyotaka Uji\",\"character\":\"Ultraman Victory\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kDJy8xf5cCWqi8eF0G85U8xu0fA.jpg\"},{\"id\":1658221,\"name\":\"Kensuke Takahashi\",\"character\":\"Ultraman X\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wMnOgZBN0mPs7JU0uH9cEoFT43J.jpg\"},{\"id\":1008384,\"name\":\"Hideo Ishiguro\",\"character\":\"Ultraman Orb\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aLhRI4k5NQoxF2bXhfiho0dy2IK.jpg\"},{\"id\":1034362,\"name\":\"Tatsuomi Hamada\",\"character\":\"Ultraman Geed\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ukMeez5uM6AjwPDv7dud0uMeIKZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1762681,\"name\":\"Yuya Hirata\",\"character\":\"Ultraman Rosso\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lHW4k3IRR3XiQfWD6RJkQpr2o0s.jpg\"},{\"id\":2087227,\"name\":\"Ryosuke Koike\",\"character\":\"Ultraman Blu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5koGBdojNC4lk2m2qcSPbxCKWGV.jpg\"},{\"id\":1910234,\"name\":\"Arisa Sonohara\",\"character\":\"Ultrawoman Grigio\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7SBP4Tcjt9qrKViU5T61z6XKBJj.jpg\"},{\"id\":93803,\"name\":\"Mamoru Miyano\",\"character\":\"Ultraman Zero\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nuok8ueG7k9hPZ09Tpr8e7Qn0ah.jpg\"},{\"id\":2020490,\"name\":\"Wataru Komada\",\"character\":\"Ultraman Ribut\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qcUXzl6RRRhEFHiRtg4ATOhbXDl.jpg\"},{\"id\":554368,\"name\":\"Hiroya Ishimaru\",\"character\":\"Ultraman Taro\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6h15xlrU8rSQgfH2dreDrYx0Y1z.jpg\"},{\"id\":144655,\"name\":\"Tomokazu Sugita\",\"character\":\"Dark Lugiel\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cv5zuPZySNsHXu24pjKLYCRzJ2J.jpg\"},{\"id\":1154452,\"name\":\"Tatsuhisa Suzuki\",\"character\":\"Etelgar\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/foytL2OreKzQcTNftz2qMgClKKg.jpg\"},{\"id\":1492992,\"name\":\"Yuma Uchida\",\"character\":\"Ultraman Tregear\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2otstbLfQ7MXuFt1X8MFOb4OIgd.jpg\"}],\"franchise\":{\"name\":\"Ultra Galaxy Fight Series\",\"parts\":[{\"id\":1105619,\"title\":\"Ultra Galaxy Fight: New Generation Heroes\",\"year\":2020,\"rating\":7.6},{\"id\":992029,\"title\":\"Ultra Galaxy Fight: The Destined Crossroad\",\"year\":2021,\"rating\":10},{\"id\":1191973,\"title\":\"Ultra Galaxy Fight: The Absolute Conspiracy\",\"year\":2021,\"rating\":10}]},\"similar\":[{\"id\":1368337,\"title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c7btGYblBnfAaw713WvFM0Kimc7.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980431,\"title\":\"Avatar Aang: The Last Airbender\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3sgnSfNT27Bx5O5ukr7B26mhEQq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezbrL1dMymKQZw7mDEWa2ZTzN7d.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Avatar Aang, the world's last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":120,\"title\":\"The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6oom5QYQ2yQTMJIbnvbkBL9cHo6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oiwc338EoBgS4sEI2ixAny4KQKg.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young hobbit Frodo Baggins, after inheriting a mysterious ring from his uncle Bilbo, must leave his home in order to keep it from falling into the hands of its evil creator. Along the way, a fellowship is formed to protect the ringbearer and make sure that the ring arrives at its final destination: Mt. Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":453395,\"title\":\"Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ddJcSKbcp4rKZTmuyWaMhuwcfMz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AdyJH8kDm8xT8IKTlgpEC15ny4u.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Doctor Strange, with the help of mystical allies both old and new, traverses the mind-bending and dangerous alternate realities of the Multiverse to confront a mysterious new adversary.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":122917,\"title\":\"The Hobbit: The Battle of the Five Armies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xT98tLqatZPQApyRmlPL12LtiWp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3UbaCMmqOd7mca4Y5DOzY2ZVTyX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following Smaug's attack on Laketown, Bilbo and the dwarves try to defend Erebor's mountain of treasure from others who claim it: the men of the ruined Laketown and the elves of Mirkwood. Meanwhile an army of Orcs led by Azog the Defiler is marching on Erebor, fueled by the rise of the dark lord Sauron. Dwarves, elves and men must unite, and the hope for Middle-Earth falls into Bilbo's hands.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":566525,\"title\":\"Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9f2Q0U3IOsLgrI2HkvldwSABZy5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r7K6Xt0RX4Mw0cAbZVw5cyb1Tux.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shang-Chi must confront the past he thought he left behind when he is drawn into the web of the mysterious Ten Rings organization.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22,\"title\":\"Pirates of the Caribbean: The Curse of the Black Pearl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/poHwCZeWzJCShH7tOjg8RIoyjcw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uRNgkJSkNBFbbn9fPsEjDIy8Sh3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When wily pirate Captain Barbossa seizes Jack Sparrow’s beloved ship, the Black Pearl, and kidnaps the governor’s daughter, Elizabeth Swann, blacksmith Will Turner reluctantly teams up with the unpredictable pirate Jack to rescue her—only to uncover a terrifying curse that turns Barbossa’s crew into the undead.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980477,\"title\":\"Ne Zha 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fcs5AdCKliQaQgXsPS9kDejamIJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gd9kxeEEONj5SECs4GA8Ddn3czI.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a catastrophic event leaves their bodies destroyed, Ne Zha and Ao Bing are granted a fragile second chance at life. As tensions rise between the dragon clans and celestial forces, the two must undergo a series of perilous trials that will test their bond, challenge their identities, and decide the fate of both mortals and immortals.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"M2EGeq1THgE\",\"name\":\"-Trailer- ULTRAMAN \\\"ULTRA GALAXY FIGHT:NEW GENERATION HEROES\\\"Exclusively on YouTube ! -English ver.-\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}